==History==
2016
*The Archers [[Cards|card]] was added with [[Version History#Softlaunch on iOS (4/1/2016)|Clash Royale's game launch]] on 4/1/2016 {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]] decreased the Archers' Sight Range to 5.5 tiles (from 6 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 23/3/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (23/3/2016)|Balance Update]] decreased the Archers' First Attack Period to 0.1 seconds (from 0.2 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]] increased the {{Rarity|Common}} card Level Cap to 13 (from 12) {{Balance|Buff}}. The update also fixed the “range bug” by decreasing the Archers' Range to 5 tiles (from 5.5 tiles), {{Balance|Nerf}} but maintaining their effective Range.
*On 24/8/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (24/8/2016)|Balance Update]] increased the Archers' Damage by 2% {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 19/9/2016, the [[Version History#September 2016 Update (19/9/2016)|September 2016 Update]] changed the Archers' description. It used to say: “''A pair of unarmored ranged attackers. They'll help you with ground and air unit attacks, but you're on your own with coloring your hair.''" {{Balance|Neutral}}.
2017
*On 23/1/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (23/1/2017)|Balance Update]] decreased the Archers' Hitpoints by 4% {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 16/3/2017, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (16/3/2017)|maintenance break]] increased the Archers' Projectile Speed to 600 (from 400) {{Balance|Buff}}. This was done to fix some unexpected behaviour that the Archers showed.
2018
*On 3/12/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/12/2018)|Balance Update]] increased the Archers’ Damage by 2.5% {{Balance|Buff}} and decreased their Hitpoints by 1% {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 5/12/2018, the [[Version History#December 2018 Update (5/12/2018)|December 2018 Update]] increased the Archers' Range to 5.5 tiles (from 5 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}}. This change was not mentioned in any change notes and was later said to be unintentional by Supercell, and as such, it was reverted in a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (7/12/2018)|maintenance break]] on 7/12/2018 {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2019
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End of November 2019 Update (26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]] added a card render to the Archers' card info screen {{Balance|Add}}.
2020
*On 2/6/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/6/2020)|Balance Update]] gave the Archers a delay between each other when deployed, with the second Archer spawning 0.1 seconds after the first {{Balance|Add}}.
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions Update (27/10/2021)|Champions Update]] increased the Level Cap of all cards to 14 (from 13) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2022
*On 4/4/2022, the [[Version History#April 2022 Update (4/4/2022)|April 2022 Update]] decreased the Archers' Attack Period to 1.1 seconds (from 1.2 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2023
